{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Promise Tree of Alden</i> is a short, atmospheric narrative experience about remorse, memory, and the silence of a forest once alive.<br>You play as Alden \u2014 a man burdened by the past, haunted by what he surrendered: his home among the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the journey unfolds as a contemplative walking experience, where every step deepens the bond between man and nature. Yet, at times, you\u2019ll ascend into the mist \u2014 soaring among ethereal orbs that drift through the air. These fragile lights aren\u2019t always easy to find, turning your search into a quiet challenge of discovery and perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathe in the lingering fog of what once was. Let the forest tell its story \u2014 not through words, but through light, sound, and stillness. <i>The Promise Tree of Alden</i> is a brief but heartfelt passage through loss, memory, and the faint glow of redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: The core aspect of this game is the atmosphere. It is recommended for those who mostly seek to experience the mood.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4128860/b5b3a25b795c8a91e6e6b3adbc2b54dde0bf7150.jpg"},{"name":"Noticed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4128860/b5b3a25b795c8a91e6e6b3adbc2b54dde0bf7150.jpg"},{"name":"Broke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4128860/b5b3a25b795c8a91e6e6b3adbc2b54dde0bf7150.jpg"},{"name":"Forgot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4128860/b5b3a25b795c8a91e6e6b3adbc2b54dde0bf7150.jpg"},{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4128860/b5b3a25b795c8a91e6e6b3adbc2b54dde0bf7150.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4128860?t=1772924843","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128860/bf7e4733533f12836e061db017bc018f198696e3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772924843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128860/5239af5e2a3f5f2dc82825be6914e549cc064f3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772924843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128860/5239af5e2a3f5f2dc82825be6914e549cc064f3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772924843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4205560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Promise Tree of Alden</i> is a short, atmospheric narrative experience about remorse, memory, and the silence of a forest once alive.<br>You play as Alden \u2014 a man burdened by the past, haunted by what he surrendered: his home among the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the journey unfolds as a contemplative walking experience, where every step deepens the bond between man and nature. Yet, at times, you\u2019ll ascend into the mist \u2014 soaring among ethereal orbs that drift through the air. These fragile lights aren\u2019t always easy to find, turning your search into a quiet challenge of discovery and perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathe in the lingering fog of what once was. Let the forest tell its story \u2014 not through words, but through light, sound, and stillness. <i>The Promise Tree of Alden</i> is a brief but heartfelt passage through loss, memory, and the faint glow of redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: The core aspect of this game is the atmosphere. It is recommended for those who mostly seek to experience the mood.</p>","developers":["Tongu\u00e7 Bodur"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128860/1596a2cea68203e7348685174284d6f980c7a6e5/header.jpg?t=1772924843","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4128860/1138721733/d27aafb1c90b7e0f81003499fcaff9c21251ff57/1762391048/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762392686","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4128860/1138721733/d27aafb1c90b7e0f81003499fcaff9c21251ff57/1762391048/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762392686","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4128860/1138721733/d27aafb1c90b7e0f81003499fcaff9c21251ff57/1762391048/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762392686","id":257227412,"name":"The Promise Tree of Alden Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227412/335b3d8b39a394924d773f43bdde96611e818dc6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762392686"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4128860/1819598657/92f0afc17676598370e73f2f3b2d61b42ebc9102/1762069994/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762392687","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4128860/1819598657/92f0afc17676598370e73f2f3b2d61b42ebc9102/1762069994/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762392687","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail